        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Master Coach 业界高手，他们的五项技能</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif;\n    background: #cfc0e0;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 720px;\n    min-height: 940px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    display: flex;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #b9a4d6 0%, #d8c7e6 45%, #ecdfe9 100%);\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n  /* Left sidebar */\n  .sidebar {\n    width: 240px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #3c2a63 0%, #4a3670 60%, #6b4f8f 100%);\n    position: relative;\n    padding: 30px 18px 30px 40px;\n  }\n  .vertical-text {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 8px;\n    top: 30px;\n    bottom: 30px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    text-orientation: upright;\n    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 6px;\n  }\n  .title-box {\n    background: #f4c81a;\n    padding: 18px 16px;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n    color: #1c1c1c;\n  }\n  .title-box .en {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .title-box .cn {\n    font-size: 22px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n\n  /* Right content */\n  .content {\n    flex: 1;\n    padding: 26px 26px 26px 22px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 14px;\n  }\n\n  .section-header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    background: #f4c81a;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 6px 14px 6px 6px;\n    width: fit-content;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .num-circle {\n    width: 24px;\n    height: 24px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #f4813f;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n  .section-title {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #1c1c1c;\n  }\n\n  .bullet-list {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin: 0 0 4px 4px;\n  }\n  .bullet-item {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n  .bullet-icon {\n    width: 15px;\n    height: 15px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #f4813f;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    margin-top: 3px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .bullet-icon::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 4px;\n    top: 2px;\n    width: 5px;\n    height: 8px;\n    border: solid white;\n    border-width: 0 2px 2px 0;\n    transform: rotate(40deg);\n  }\n  .bullet-text {\n    font-size: 12.5px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #2b2b2b;\n  }\n\n  .section {\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"sidebar\">\n    <div class=\"title-box\">\n      <div class=\"en\">Master<br>Coach</div>\n      <div class=\"cn\">业界高手，<br>他们的五项<br>技能</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"vertical-text\">ZONG HENG SI HAI</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"content\">\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <div class=\"num-circle\">1</div>\n        <div class=\"section-title\">知识矩阵</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bullet-list\">\n        <div class=\"bullet-item\"><div class=\"bullet-icon\"></div><div class=\"bullet-text\">从各个角度思考，推演出无穷无尽的点</div></div>\n        <div class=\"bullet-item\"><div class=\"bullet-icon\"></div><div class=\"bullet-text\">是一种神秘的混合物，包含了技术上的知识、策略、经验</div></div>\n        <div class=\"bullet-item\"><div class=\"bullet-icon\"></div><div class=\"bullet-text\">能信手拈来，判断理解学生的进度，接下来应该朝哪些方向努力</div></div>\n        <div class=\"bullet-item\"><div class=\"bullet-icon\"></div><div class=\"bullet-text\">这是「教」的知识矩阵，属于伯乐独有的心理表征，而不是「做」的知识矩阵。教学是一项区别于亲身实践的独立技能。</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <div class=\"num-circle\">2</div>\n        <div class=\"section-title\">洞察力</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bullet-list\">\n        <div class=\"bullet-item\"><div class=\"bullet-icon\"></div><div class=\"bullet-text\">著名的篮球教练 John Wooden，对一些球员大多是表扬，对另一些球员则主要是批评</div></div>\n        <div class=\"bullet-item\"><div class=\"bullet-icon\"></div><div class=\"bullet-text\">Wooden认为，每一位球员的身高、体重、背景、智力、才能，都不一样，每一位球员都需要区别对待</div></div>\n        <div class=\"bullet-item\"><div class=\"bullet-icon\"></div><div class=\"bullet-text\">好的教练必须拥有对他人（而不仅仅是对自己）极高的洞察力，才能因材施教</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <div class=\"num-circle\">3</div>\n        <div class=\"section-title\">简洁的指示</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bullet-list\">\n        <div class=\"bullet-item\"><div class=\"bullet-icon\"></div><div class=\"bullet-text\">John Wooden的话很少超过20秒；动作示范才3秒</div></div>\n        <div class=\"bullet-item\"><div class=\"bullet-icon\"></div><div class=\"bullet-text\">在记录的2326次教学行为中，仅6.9%是表扬，6.6%是批评。75%是纯粹的信息：该咋样、怎么做、何时强化</div></div>\n        <div class=\"bullet-item\"><div class=\"bullet-icon\"></div><div class=\"bullet-text\">示范使用总分为：先看整体如何，再拆解（或演示错误的做法），再整体</div></div>\n        <div class=\"bullet-item\"><div class=\"bullet-icon\"></div><div class=\"bullet-text\">这对表达能力是很高的要求</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"section-header\">\n        <div class=\"num-circle\">4</div>\n        <div class=\"section-title\">个人魅力</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bullet-list\">\n        <div class=\"bullet-item\"><div class=\"bullet-icon\"></div><div class=\"bullet-text\">天才的早期老师，大多不是业界高手，但天才会跟他们学习长达5-6年的时间</div></div>\n        <div class=\"bullet-item\"><div class=\"bullet-icon\"></div><div class=\"bullet-text\">他们是那种孩子喜欢的老师，和蔫可亲，对孩子鼓励，给孩子糖果，赞扬孩子等</div></div>\n        <div class=\"bullet-item\"><div class=\"bullet-icon\"></div><div class=\"bullet-text\">万事开头难，一开始处都在错，重点是把这件事变得令人向往、愉快、能坚持、有所回报</div></div>\n        <div class=\"bullet-item\"><div class=\"bullet-icon\"></div><div class=\"bullet-text\">教练必须拥有共情力，有个人魅力，牢牢吸住学生</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
